{
    "name": "E2E SuperOffice - Record Updated trigger",
    "description": "Record Updated (follow-up, Completed changes to Completed) fires when the flow completes a task it created.",
    "notes": {
        "e22aeb5d-fc56-46d7-b09e-12bcbd8c4133": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 560,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## Test data\n\nRecord Updated polls every minute and its first tick only records the current state. The flow waits 1 minute, creates a task (not completed) and then marks it completed with Update Record. The trigger watches follow-ups for Completed changes to Completed and must report this task. Do not remove the Wait. AfterAll timeout is 300 s."
        }
    },
